# Two Federation destroyers on layouts/emitters.jsonc: Venting starts with its engines and life support destroyed;
# Intact is undamaged.
# - Spray: Venting's plasma and steam damage emitters spray. The dumps name the damage nodes each model shows; the
#   "spray" shots, a fraction of a second apart, show the spray build up.
# - Sparks: both of Venting's systems repair and throw a repair spark at one of their target hardpoints every half
#   second, the first at 0.52 s; Intact is whole and throws none. Each spark shows for one second ("sparks" shots).
# - Vent fade: the engines are whole again first, at about 7.5 s: the plasma vent then stops spraying, and its last
#   particles fly on and fade within their lifespan, while the steam vent of life support still sprays. After the
#   spray shots the fast-forward runs the world, undrawn, until the engines are nearly whole (9 of 10 hit points); the
#   "fade" shots then show the vent stop, and the "vent" dumps show when the engines are whole.
# Run it with --layout layouts/emitters.jsonc; the layout's header comment has the whole command.
scroll up 20
wait 0.3
shot spray-1
dump d1
wait 0.4
shot sparks-1
wait 0.1
shot spray-2
wait 0.2
shot sparks-2
wait 0.3
shot spray-3
wait 0.3
shot sparks-3
wait 1.2
shot spray-4
dump d2
fast-forward until Venting Engines >= 9 max 10
wait 0.3
shot fade-1
dump vent-1
wait 1
shot fade-2
dump vent-2
wait 1
shot fade-3
dump vent-3
wait 1.5
shot fade-4
dump vent-4
